<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Two scatter plots show relationships between variables and Integrity Belief Index \(IBI\). The left plot shows a negative correlation \(r = -0.46\) between Copy Ratio \(CR\) and IBI; as CR increases, IBI decreases. The right plot shows a positive correlation \(r = 0.42\) between Levenshtein Distance \(LD\) and IBI; as LD increases, IBI increases.) /K 418 0 R /P 54 0 R /Pg 10 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
