377 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Bar chart comparing mean acceptability scores from students and teachers for various academic writing activities. Students consistently rate all activities as more acceptable than teachers, with the highest scores for brainstorming and outlining, and the lowest for paraphrasing and translation.) /K 419 0 R /P 54 0 R /Pg 11 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
